      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "$ m_{t}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{m}_{t-1}+(1-\\beta_{1})\\cdot\\nabla_{\\theta}L(\\theta_{t}) $",
