    {
      "type": "formula",
      "latex": "$ v_{t}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2}\\cdot\\boldsymbol{v}_{t-1}+\\left(1-\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2}\\right)\\cdot\\left(\\nabla_{\\theta}L(\\theta_{t})\\right)^{2} $",
